While in prison for more than a year, Ms. Mony learned of the many forms of life of prisoners, some of whom had previously been severely violated due to misunderstandings.
The man was wearing military boots, military boots, and was trampled on, so he had to answer when he did not answer, he was afraid he would get sick.
Such torture was initially detained at the police station before being taken to court and prison.
At the court stage, although there was no torture, the court demanded money from the accused and when there was no money, they decided to detain or prosecute without justice.
This was confirmed by Ms. Lim Mony, who questioned the women in prison together.
But most Vietnamese women have money, they have money to eat, they have more money to live in prison than Cambodian women prisoners.
Due to her character as an educator and counselor, Lim Mony is considered a mother in Room A3 of Prey Sar Prison.
Both prison officials and inmates have respected and valued her above all other prisoners because she sometimes acts as a mediator in disputes and always gives you good advice. Punishment to do what society recognizes and avoid misfortune.
Also, whoever those children are, I order them to read books.
Although she used to be respected as a mistress, this is not Lim Mony's preference, she wants to value each other out of genuine feelings. Will each other.
Due to differing views on the role of serving the society, her life partner, who belongs to a family of high-ranking dignitaries, reached a crossroads in 2005.
He always scolded me or dragged me many times, but I think I can tolerate anything, but what he pulls me to do any work that I do not like, I can not follow him.
If we do not live in harmony, he does not like my work, he goes to choose what he likes, I do not get angry with him.
Living as a 61-year-old widow, Lim Mony is responsible for raising two children.
