The market is higher than the wage increase, but if it goes up, he has to hold the market.
Born in Saang district, Kandal province, Professor Rong Chhun is the third child in a family of farming parents.
He graduated from Trauy Sla Secondary School and Prek Ta Duong High School in Koh Thom District, Kandal Province.
After graduating from high school in 1985, he went on to study at the Royal University of Phnom Penh, graduating in 1993 with a bachelor's degree in mathematics and returning to teach at Saang High School in Phnom Penh. Kandal province.
In addition to studying in the country, Mr. Rong Chhun also went to study many short courses abroad, such as Japan, Malaysia, etc., and participated in social work in Europe and Asia many times.
Although Rong Chhun is a staff professor at the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports, in 1997 he joined Chea Vichea Vichea, a well-known trade union movement close to the opposition, who was shot dead by gunmen in 2004.
While serving as a professor of mathematics, he also founded the prestigious Cambodian Independent Teachers Association in 2000, which acts as a protector and seeker of justice for teachers.
By 2006, he had formed the Cambodian Confederation of Trade Unions, with many more unions and associations taking refuge under the union's umbrella.
Mr. Rong Chhun is currently an official of the Ministry of Education, but he suspended his name for a while when he joined the NEC in April 2015, earning more than 2,000 US dollars. Luxury car, but he resigned without remorse.
All work is valuable, even if you do not accept the title of Excellency, we come to work to help the people, the value is the same, and if you get the title of Excellency, betray your own will by robbing the will of the people for His Excellency's title, it does not exist. What is the price?
Although the National Election Committee (NEC) needs to add three more members to replace members of the CNRP quota who recently resigned due to the dissolution of their party, an institution that is considered an independent arbitrator And that neutrality may no longer have the neutrality and trust of the electorate, and because this institution has lost the original elements and forms of its role.
