The new NEC, which has two quota members, the ruling party and the opposition and an NGO, has a high percentage of good confidence in the electorate.
When there is a meeting to decide something, this neutral body never voted by hand or by secret ballot, that is, all nine members must coordinate to find a peaceful solution to achieve something that the NEC All you have to do is never strain your neck.
If we look at the list, there were a lot of ghost lists in the past, but now we do not have a ghost list, and the election was full of mistakes, but only a few mistakes.
But what we discussed, we had to do well, but finally the CNRP was dissolved on the 16th and we resigned as promised.
Before taking a seat at the NEC, I promised that if I could not protect the will of the people, I would resign.
In the NEC, he has the title of Excellency, has a decent salary, has a luxury car regime, has a driver, has a bodyguard, but all this is not Rong Chhun's wish.
