Mr. Puy Kea said that since growing up, he has dreamed of becoming a representative ambassador for Cambodia in any country where he can disseminate information about Cambodia's culture and natural potential to attract investment and tourism. Foreign.
He stated that he had been working as a journalist for two decades as a journalist working for the Japanese foreign news agency Kyodo in Cambodia.
